Subject: [PATCH 02515/11362] [conductor] PHASE E4 (CAPSTONE .404) -- the
 milestone scorecard + the HEADLINE DECISION. Headline questions: (1) did the
 STRONGER learned-heuristic class (LLM-generated Python action-cost
 heuristics, exp4370) DEEPEN the oracle-distinct EFFICIENCY moat -- beat the
 deployed linear heuristic on held-out actions, leakage-clean +
 reproduction-gated (exp4370 llm_heuristic_beats_linear) + contamination-free
 (exp4371 win_is_contamination_free)? -> the efficiency moat graduates from
 'linear' to 'stronger-function-class', or a clean null settles the function
 class. (2) ARC north star: the new reproducible_total_levels (>=33?) across
 exp4372 (deeper high-headroom) + exp4373 (ar25/ka59/ft09 L2); how many NEW
 levels/games. (3) DiffusionGemma in-generation moat: did the scorer-repair +
 CoDiLA scorer-independent control CONVERT the moat (exp4374
 s3_guided_beats_control), produce a clean null, or RETIRE the direction (4th
 block)? (4) oracle-distinct ACCURACY frontier: did the verifier-as-detector
 beat chance where selection headroom is ~0 (exp4375 detector_beats_chance)?
 Aggregate (SKIP any flagged_adversarial artifact; HONOR verifier_is_oracle --
 a circular/execution-grounded win is NOT a moat). Emit verifier_thesis_state
 (one honest string) + efficiency_moat_state (one of: deepened_stronger_class
 / linear_is_settled / open) + s3_moat_utility (one of: useful_generation_gain
 / proven_but_not_useful / retired / open) + reproducible_total_levels +
 detector_beats_chance. Compute the G1-G4 publication gate via
 publication_gate.py. Use the robust aggregate-available-report-gaps helper
 (NO hard-block-all-False). CARRY verifier_is_oracle correctly (the durable
 exp4355 stamp fix) so this capstone does NOT trip CIRCULAR_MOAT_OVERCLAIM. NO
 gated_on.

Automated research step by research conductor.
